  failureResultCopies:
  - family: 0
    titles:
    - GRID DRAINED
    - GROUND FAULT
    messages:
    - The grounded block killed the transfer.
    - The city lost charge to a grounded blocker.
  - family: 1
    titles:
    - SIGNAL RUPTURE
    - LINE CUT
    messages:
    - A sharp utility hazard split the transfer.
    - The conduit ruptured before the district held.
  - family: 2
    titles:
    - OVERLOAD
    - ARC FAILURE
    messages:
    - A live hazard overloaded the grid.
    - The transfer spiked out in an electric surge.
  - family: 3
    titles:
    - ROTOR HIT
    - MAINTENANCE FAILURE
    messages:
    - An industrial rotor cut the charge path.
    - The city line failed inside a rotating hazard.
  - family: 4
    titles:
    - LINE INTERRUPTED
    - CONDUIT BROKEN
    messages:
    - The transfer dropped into a broken conduit.
    - The line gave out before the next district lit.
  - family: 5
    titles:
    - PRESSURE COLLAPSE
    - SIDE IMPACT
    messages:
    - A side-pressure hazard crushed the transfer.
    - Grid pressure closed in before the reroute held.
